      "observed_evidence": "ThreadSanitizer detected a data race: write to right at 0x5555569e66c0 by T1 (mutex M0) and previous read of right at same location by T2. The write occurs after left is set but before right is set, and the read occurs after left is read but before right is read. The mutex guard is held during both accesses in update_pair, but the read in snapshot_ok is not protected by any synchronization."
